  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1409.01 Notice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1409.01 Notice.\n\n(a) In any case in which a suspension of operation is ordered by the commissioner or his authorized agent pursuant to RSA 321-A:7, the written notice required by that statute shall be issued on the “Notice of Suspension” form.\n\n(b) The form shall include all of the following:\n\n(1) The owner or operator’s name;\n\n(2) Date of issuance;\n\n(3) Order to cease operation;\n\n(4) Identification of carnival or amusement rides covered by such order;\n\n(5) Notification that the carnival or amusement ride shall remain closed until permission to reopen is expressly granted by the commissioner or agent;\n\n(6) Reason for suspension;\n\n(7) Required corrective action; and\n\n(8) Affidavit of service which shall include:\n\na. Certification that the order was served on the owner or operator;\n\nb. Date and time of such service; and\n\nc. Signature of person making service.\n\nSource. #2229, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2950, eff 1-3-85; ss by #4531, eff 1-1-89; ss by #5940, INTERIM, eff 1-1-95; ss by #5952, eff 1-24-95, EXPIRED: 1-24-03\n\nNew. #7833, INTERIM, eff 2-22-03, EXPIRED: 8-21-03\n\nNew. #8045, eff 2-20-04; ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)\n\nNew. #10507, eff 1-21-14, EXPIRED: 1-21-24\n\nNew. #14011, INTERIM, eff 6-27-24; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
